# Phase 3+: dist/ is the committed golden output (rebuilt + diffed in CI). Nothing to ignore
# yet; keep the file as the anchor for future authoring-repo ignores.

# Git worktrees created inside the repo (EnterWorktree defaults here). These are gitlinks, not
# content: release.ps1 does `git add -A`, which swept one into each of v0.42.0 and v0.43.0 as a
# stray 160000 entry pointing at a directory that no longer exists once the worktree is removed.
.claude/worktrees/

# Plan-mode drafts (`plansDirectory` in .claude/settings.json). Random-slug drafts never reach a
# tracked directory; promote a plan you keep by renaming it to .claude/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md.
.claude/plans/inbox/*
!.claude/plans/inbox/.gitkeep

# Personal, per-machine Claude Code overrides. Loaded alongside the tracked files; never team config.
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
